graph TD
    Start[Requisição REST /api] --> Guard{JWT válido?}
    Guard -->|Não| PublicCheck{Decorator @Public?}
    PublicCheck -->|Sim| Controller[Controller específico]
    PublicCheck -->|Não| AuthError[401 Unauthorized]

    Guard -->|Sim| Controller
    Controller --> Pipes[ValidationPipe]
    Pipes --> Service[Service do módulo]
    Service --> Repo[TypeORM Repository]
    Repo --> Database[(PostgreSQL)]

    Service -->|Eventos| NotificationsService
    NotificationsService --> DeviceTokens[(device_tokens)]
    NotificationsService --> NotificationSettings[(notification_settings)]

    Controller --> MetricsInterceptor[MetricsInterceptor]
    MetricsInterceptor --> PromClient[prom-client]
    PromClient --> MetricsEndpoint[/api/metrics/]
